flowchart TD
  Need[Need fewer duplicates?] --> Q1{Need a stable integration key for upsert?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Ext[External ID plus Unique if the key must be one-to-one]
  Q1 -->|No UI twins| Q2{Need fuzzy compare across fields?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| MR[Matching rule]
  MR --> Q3{What should the user or API do?}
  Q3 -->|Warn or block or report| DR[Duplicate rule using that matching rule]
  Q3 -->|Sweep existing rows| Job[Duplicate job]
  Q2 -->|Exact one field only| Uniq[Unique attribute without calling it a matching rule]
